#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/Sections/PatternsSection.php:43
msgid ""
"Block patterns registered for custom post types. Use the Translate button to "
"produce a language variant. The translated content is saved here and can be "
"copied into any CPT post from the block editor Pattern inserter or used as a "
"starting point for a Synced Pattern (Reusable Block)."
msgstr ""
"Ezarritako blokeak post moten pertsonalizatuak. Erabili Itzuli botoia "
"hizkuntza bertsioa sortzeko. Edukia itzulita hemen gordetzen da eta CPT post "
"batean kopiatu daiteke blokea editorearen Pattern inserter-etik edo erabil "
"daiteke Pattern Sinked (Erabilgarri Blokea) hasteko."

