#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:105
msgid ""
"Translation Limits: control which user roles can trigger AI translation, and "
"set a monthly token budget. Exceeding the budget suspends AI calls until the "
"month resets."
msgstr ""
"Itzulpenaren mugak: kontrolatu zein erabiltzaile rolek aktibatu dezaketen AI "
"itzulpena, eta ezarri hilean tokens kopurua. Aurrez aurreko kopurua "
"gaindituz, AI deien erabilera etengo da hilabetea berritzen den arte."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:166
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:177
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:418
msgid "Translation Memory"
msgstr "Itzulpen Memoria"

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:107
msgid ""
"Translation Memory caches AI results by content hash, language pair, "
"provider, and model. Editing a post invalidates the cache entry so the next "
"translate call gets a fresh result."
msgstr ""
"Itzulpen Memoriak AI emaitzak cacheatzen ditu edukien hash, hizkuntza bikote,"
" hornitzaile eta modelaren arabera. Post bat editatzeak cachea baliogabetzen "
"du, beraz hurrengo itzulpenak emaitza fresko bat jasoko du."

#. translators: %d is the number of removed cached blocks.
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:389
#, php-format
msgid "Translation Memory cleared. %d cached block was removed."
msgid_plural "Translation Memory cleared. %d cached blocks were removed."
msgstr[0] "Itzulpen Memoria garbitu da. %d cacheatutako blokea kendu da."
msgstr[1] "Itzulpen Memoria garbitu da. %d cacheatutako bloke kendu dira."

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:123
msgid ""
"Translation Memory: stores the full translated post per content hash. Clear "
"it when you want to force a retranslation of all posts regardless of whether "
"their content changed."
msgstr ""
"Itzulpen Memoria: edukien hasharen arabera post guztia itzuli duena "
"gordetzen du. Garbitu hori, post guztiak berriro itzuli nahi badituzu, "
"edukiak aldatu edo ez."

